  "problem": "$10$ is **not** a prime number, and $0.1$ is a real number.\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:10\\text{\u00a0is a prime number}$\n\n- $Q:0.1\\text{\u00a0is a real number}$",
